Yup! That fixed it!

Okay, so to re-state the problem and state the solution:
    Problem:
        Actors and Devices can add Actors/Devices to the current Theatre, but adding a new Actor/Device to a map while it's being iterated through will result in early breaks and potentially other errors.
    Solution:
        Make sure Actors/Devices do not create/add new Actors/Devices in their initialization function. Theatres call that function during map iteration.

