while(theatre_settings[i][it].second.first > SANDWICH)
:::
This only accounts for there being more settings after the sandwich, not if the sandwich is the only setting. One fix (and the one I'm gonna implement) would be for the function to also have the size of all the settings in that object to compare with `it`.

